@startuml AgentCheckUpdate时序图
!theme plain
title Consul AgentCheckUpdate 方法执行时序图

participant "HTTP客户端" as Client
participant "HTTPHandlers" as HTTP
participant "Agent" as Agent
participant "CheckTTL" as TTL
participant "CheckNotifier" as Notifier
participant "LocalState" as State
participant "AntiEntropy" as AE
participant "Consul集群" as Cluster

note over Client, Cluster
    AgentCheckUpdate API 调用流程
    PUT /v1/agent/check/update/{checkID}
end note

== 1. HTTP请求处理阶段 ==

Client ->> HTTP: PUT /v1/agent/check/update/{checkID}
note right of Client
    请求体包含:
    {
      "Status": "passing|warning|critical",
      "Output": "检查输出信息"
    }
    代码位置: agent/agent_endpoint.go:928
end note

HTTP ->> HTTP: decodeBody(req.Body, &update)
note right of HTTP
    解析JSON请求体到checkUpdate结构体
    代码位置: agent/agent_endpoint.go:930
end note

alt 请求解析失败
    HTTP -->> Client: HTTP 400 Bad Request
    note right of HTTP: 返回解析错误信息
end

HTTP ->> HTTP: 验证状态值
note right of HTTP
    检查Status是否为有效值:
    - api.HealthPassing ("passing")
    - api.HealthWarning ("warning") 
    - api.HealthCritical ("critical")
    代码位置: agent/agent_endpoint.go:934-940
end note

alt 状态值无效
    HTTP -->> Client: HTTP 400 Bad Request
    note right of HTTP: 返回"Invalid check status"错误
end

HTTP ->> HTTP: 提取CheckID
note right of HTTP
    从URL路径提取检查ID
    代码位置: agent/agent_endpoint.go:942-943
end note

HTTP ->> HTTP: agentCheckUpdate(checkID, status, output)
note right of HTTP
    调用内部处理方法
    代码位置: agent/agent_endpoint.go:945
end note

== 2. 权限验证和元数据处理阶段 ==

HTTP ->> HTTP: 创建企业版元数据
note right of HTTP
    创建EnterpriseMeta结构
    代码位置: agent/agent_endpoint.go:949-950
end note

HTTP ->> HTTP: parseToken(req, &token)
note right of HTTP
    从请求中提取ACL令牌
    代码位置: agent/agent_endpoint.go:954
end note

HTTP ->> HTTP: parseEntMetaNoWildcard()
note right of HTTP
    解析企业版元数据（命名空间等）
    代码位置: agent/agent_endpoint.go:956-958
end note

HTTP ->> Agent: delegate.ResolveTokenAndDefaultMeta()
note right of HTTP
    解析令牌并获取授权信息
    代码位置: agent/agent_endpoint.go:960-963
end note

Agent -->> HTTP: authz, err

alt 令牌解析失败
    HTTP -->> Client: HTTP 403 Forbidden
    note right of HTTP: 返回认证错误
end

HTTP ->> HTTP: cid.Normalize()
note right of HTTP
    标准化CheckID结构
    代码位置: agent/agent_endpoint.go:965
end note

HTTP ->> Agent: vetCheckUpdateWithAuthorizer()
note right of HTTP
    验证检查更新权限
    代码位置: agent/agent_endpoint.go:967-969
end note

Agent -->> HTTP: err

alt 权限验证失败
    HTTP -->> Client: HTTP 403 Forbidden
    note right of HTTP: 返回权限不足错误
end

HTTP ->> HTTP: validateRequestPartition()
note right of HTTP
    验证请求分区
    代码位置: agent/agent_endpoint.go:971-973
end note

== 3. TTL检查更新阶段 ==

HTTP ->> Agent: updateTTLCheck(cid, status, output)
note right of HTTP
    更新TTL检查状态
    代码位置: agent/agent_endpoint.go:975
end note

Agent ->> Agent: stateLock.Lock()
note right of Agent
    获取状态锁保护并发访问
    代码位置: agent/agent.go:3478
end note

Agent ->> Agent: 查找TTL检查
note right of Agent
    从checkTTLs映射中查找检查
    代码位置: agent/agent.go:3482
end note

alt TTL检查不存在
    Agent -->> HTTP: 错误: CheckID不存在TTL
    note right of Agent
        返回"CheckID does not have associated TTL"
        代码位置: agent/agent.go:3484
    end note
    HTTP -->> Client: HTTP 500 Internal Server Error
end

Agent ->> TTL: SetStatus(status, output)
note right of Agent
    设置TTL检查状态并重置TTL计时器
    代码位置: agent/agent.go:3488
end note

TTL ->> TTL: 截断输出长度
note right of TTL
    如果输出超过最大长度则截断
    代码位置: agent/checks/check.go:318-322
end note

TTL ->> Notifier: UpdateCheck(checkID, status, output)
note right of TTL
    通知检查状态更新
    代码位置: agent/checks/check.go:323
end note

TTL ->> TTL: 保存最后输出
note right of TTL
    存储输出用于TTL过期时使用
    代码位置: agent/checks/check.go:325-327
end note

TTL ->> TTL: timer.Reset(TTL)
note right of TTL
    重置TTL计时器
    代码位置: agent/checks/check.go:329
end note

TTL -->> Agent: outputTruncated

alt 开发模式（无数据目录）
    Agent ->> Agent: stateLock.Unlock()
    Agent -->> HTTP: nil
    note right of Agent
        开发模式下不持久化状态
        代码位置: agent/agent.go:3491-3493
    end note
else 生产模式
    Agent ->> Agent: persistCheckState()
    note right of Agent
        持久化检查状态到磁盘
        代码位置: agent/agent.go:3497-3499
    end note
    
    Agent ->> Agent: 创建持久化状态
    note right of Agent
        创建persistedCheckState结构
        包含CheckID、Status、Output、Expires
        代码位置: agent/agent.go:3508-3515
    end note
    
    Agent ->> Agent: json.Marshal(state)
    note right of Agent
        序列化状态为JSON
        代码位置: agent/agent.go:3518
    end note
    
    Agent ->> Agent: 写入状态文件
    note right of Agent
        将状态写入数据目录
        代码位置: agent/agent.go:3520+
    end note
end

Agent ->> Agent: stateLock.Unlock()
Agent -->> HTTP: nil

== 4. 状态同步阶段 ==

HTTP ->> HTTP: syncChanges()
note right of HTTP
    触发状态同步到集群
    代码位置: agent/agent_endpoint.go:978
end note

HTTP ->> State: SyncChanges()
note right of HTTP
    调用本地状态同步方法
    代码位置: agent/agent_endpoint.go:779
end note

State ->> State: Lock()
note right of State
    获取状态锁
    代码位置: agent/local/state.go:1259
end note

State ->> State: 同步节点信息
note right of State
    如果节点信息未同步则先同步
    代码位置: agent/local/state.go:1266-1273
end note

State ->> State: 遍历所有服务
note right of State
    检查需要同步的服务
    代码位置: agent/local/state.go:1278-1293
end note

State ->> State: 遍历所有检查
note right of State
    检查需要同步的健康检查
    代码位置: agent/local/state.go:1297-1314
end note

loop 对于每个未同步的检查
    State ->> State: syncCheck(checkID)
    note right of State
        同步单个检查到集群
        代码位置: agent/local/state.go:1307
    end note
    
    State ->> Cluster: RPC调用 Catalog.Register
    note right of State
        通过RPC将检查注册到集群
        包含检查状态、输出等信息
    end note
    
    Cluster -->> State: 注册结果
    
    alt 同步成功
        State ->> State: 标记检查为已同步
        note right of State: c.InSync = true
    else 同步失败
        State ->> State: 记录错误
        note right of State: 保持未同步状态，等待下次重试
    end
end

State ->> State: Unlock()
State -->> HTTP: 同步结果

alt 同步失败
    HTTP ->> HTTP: 记录错误日志
    note right of HTTP
        记录"failed to sync changes"错误
        但不影响API响应
        代码位置: agent/agent_endpoint.go:780
    end note
end

== 5. 响应返回阶段 ==

HTTP -->> Client: HTTP 200 OK
note right of HTTP
    返回空响应体表示成功
    代码位置: agent/agent_endpoint.go:979
end note

note over Client, Cluster
    整个流程完成，检查状态已更新并同步到集群
    TTL计时器已重置，Anti-Entropy机制确保最终一致性
end note

@enduml
